  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingTradeNotesReceivableDiscountedOrTransferredByEndorsementTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;  ２  受取手形裏書譲渡高&lt;/p&gt;
